# Harbor upstream chart generates ConfigMaps (harbor-core, harbor-jobservice-env, harbor-registry, harbor-exporter-env)
# with application configuration templates containing keywords like 'secret' and 'key' (false positive).
# Actual sensitive secrets are stored in ExternalSecrets / Secrets (harbor-secret, harbor-registry-s3-secret, harbor-oidc-secret).
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0109 (ConfigMap with secrets)
KSV-0109
AVD-KSV-0109

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-01010 (ConfigMap with sensitive content)
KSV-01010
AVD-KSV-01010

# Harbor microservice containers (portal, core, jobservice, registry, trivy, exporter) run on Photon OS
# and require writable paths (/etc/harbor, /var/log, /tmp, /var/cache/nginx) without upstream emptyDir mounts.
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0014 (Root file system is not read-only)
KSV-0014
AVD-KSV-0014
